      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present Apartment 3, Beacon One, Beacon Court, Sandyford, Dublin 16, a superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground floor apartment ideally positioned within this highly sought-after development. Measuring approximately 71 sq. m. This impressive property offers generous living accommodation, excellent proportions throughout and the added benefit of two car parking spaces.\nThe location is second to none, with Beacon Court situated in the heart of Sandyford and within easy reach of a wealth of amenities. The area offers an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, bars and leisure facilities, while Dundrum Town Centre is just a short distance away. Transport links are exceptional, with the LUAS Green Line providing swift access towards Dublin City Centre, while the M50 and N11 are both easily accessible, making this an ideal location for commuters.\nInternally, the accommodation is bright, spacious and well laid out. The property comprises an entrance hallway, a large sitting/dining room with direct access to a private balcony, a well-appointed kitchen with island, two generous bedrooms and two bathrooms. The balcony is a particularly attractive feature, with access available from both the main living space and the master bedroom, creating a fantastic extension of the living accommodation and an ideal spot for relaxing or entertaining. The principal bedroom further benefits from its own private ensuite.\nFurther benefits include ground floor positioning, approximately 71 sq. m. of living space, a generous balcony with dual access, two bedrooms, two bathrooms and two car parking spaces. The property is being offered to the market vacant with no onward chain, allowing for a straightforward purchase and immediate occupation.\nA superb opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a quality apartment in one of South Dublin's most established and desirable locations. With generous living accommodation, excellent transport links and the added benefit of a private balcony, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers. Early viewing is highly advised.\nFeatures\n•2-bedroom / 2-bathroom ground floor apartment\n•BER C\n•Approximately 71 sq. m.\n•Large living and dining area\n•Private balcony accessed from sitting room and master bedroom\n•Master bedroom with ensuite\n•2 car parking spaces\n•Vacant with no onward chain\n•Excellent transport links\n•LUAS, M50 & N11 within easy reach\n•Close to Dundrum Town Centre\n•Highly sought-after Sandyford location\n\nDirections \nEircode - D18 FK71\n"
      },
      {
